# Local credentials and runtime state must never enter a deployment bundle.
**/.env*
**/.data/**
**/prisma/*.db
**/prisma/*.db-*
**/public/uploads/**

# Local build, browser, and diagnostic artifacts.
**/.next/**
**/.next-build/**
**/.next-build-*/**
**/.playwright-cli/**
**/node_modules/**
**/output/**
**/test-results/**
**/*.log
